OL,3,GNEWSAWife 'felt stranger's hand' during
OL,4,Asex, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman said she locked herself in a
OL,7,Fbathroom after realising her
OL,8,Fthen-husband had allowed someone else
OL,9,Fin the bedroom while she was
OL,10,Fblindfolded and having sex, a jury has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FIn a police interview played at
OL,14,FWinchester Crown Court, Joanne Young
OL,15,Fsaid she was restrained when she felt a
OL,16,Fhand on her wrist which she believed
OL,17,Fdid not belong to her now ex-husband
OL,18,FPhilip Young.
