OL,3,GNEWSAWife 'felt stranger's hand' during
OL,4,Asex, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoanne - who has waived her legal right
OL,7,Fto anonymity - said Young, who has
OL,8,Fadmitted drugging and raping her, later
OL,9,Fapologised and told her he had invited
OL,10,Fsomeone to watch the couple have sex
OL,11,Fafter browsing online forums.
OL,13,FFour men who Young is alleged to have
OL,14,Frecruited to abuse his wife at their
OL,15,Fhome are now on trial.
